            <ArticleTitle>Analgesic activity of Enhydra fluctuans.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>707-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The methanol extract of Enhydra fluctuans, given orally at the dose of 250 and 500 mg/kg, was evaluated for its analgesic activity using the acetic acid induced writhing and the tail-flick methods. The extract showed promising activity in both tests.</AbstractText>
